virals.text:
AI agents can now book your hotel and pay for it with crypto.

@travalacom is teaming up with @BNBCHAIN and @binance Pay to make it possible, with access to 2.2 million hotels worldwide.

Travala's Juan Otero joins @jennsanasie to explain how it works, why crypto rails are suited

